### Step 1 — run with VS Code "REST Client" extension
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Not logged in → 401 with JSON error { "error": { "code": "UNAUTHORIZED", ... } }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/anything

### CORS preflight from frontend dev server → 200 + Access-Control-Allow-Origin header
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Origin: http://localhost:5500
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST

### CORS preflight from unknown site → 403, no Access-Control-Allow-Origin header
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Origin: https://evil.example.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST

# 400 / 404 / 405 / 500 responses need a logged-in user, so they are verified by
# ErrorHandlingTest for now; real endpoints from Step 2 onward will show them here.
